:INFO
Art. 7a Institutional beneficiaries enjoying preferential rights, immunities and facilities
The acquisition of immovable property for official purposes by institutional beneficiaries enjoying privileges, immunities and facilities under Article 2 paragraph 1 of the Host State Act of 22 June 2007 is governed by exclusively by Chapter 3 of the Host State Act.
|

:NOTE
Art. 7a — Inserted by Annex No II 3 of the Host State Act of 22 June 2007, in force since 1 Jan. 2008 (AS 2007 6637; BBl 2006 8017).
